OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fcloudy and windy this evening with
OL,7,Fsome further spells of showery rain.
OL,8,FWinds easing overnight with rain also
OL,9,Fgradually fading for most places by
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAny lingering rain generally
OL,13,Fclearing throughout the morning,
OL,14,Fleaving a largely dry afternoon with
OL,15,Fsome bright spells developing.
OL,16,FTemperatures around average with
OL,17,Flighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
